<title>USA: FirstCity Financial to buy mortgage firm.</title>
<headline>FirstCity Financial to buy mortgage firm.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>FirstCity Financial Corp said Thursday it has executed a letter of intent to acquire Harbor Financial Group Inc for 1.6 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Harbor is the parent company of Houston-based Harbor Financial Mortgage Corp and Dallas-based New America Financial Inc, two mortgage banking firms.</p>
<p>After the merger, Harbor is to operate as a wholly owned subsidiary.</p>
